# Caddy edge (prompt 24). The ONLY publicly published container (80/443). Terminates TLS
# automatically for the operator-supplied domain and reverse-proxies to the internal gateway
# by Docker-network name; search, orchestrator, worker, sweeper and Redis are never exposed.
{
	admin off
	email ops@{$API_DOMAIN}
}

{$API_DOMAIN} {
	encode gzip

	header {
		Strict-Transport-Security "max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains"
		X-Content-Type-Options "nosniff"
		X-Frame-Options "DENY"
		Referrer-Policy "strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
		-Server
	}

	reverse_proxy gateway:8000 {
		health_uri /health/live
		health_interval 10s
	}
}

# Plain HTTP is redirected to HTTPS by Caddy automatically.
